sequenceDiagram
    title Daily Challenge attempt flow
    autonumber

    actor Student
    participant Page as Daily Challenge Page<br/>app/daily-challenge/page.tsx
    participant Client as dailyChallengeClient.ts
    participant API as Daily Challenge Routes<br/>app/api/daily-challenge/**
    participant Rules as dailyChallengeRules.ts
    participant DB as daily_challenge_attempt<br/>+ question / answer

    Student->>Page: Opens /daily-challenge
    Page->>Client: loadDailyChallenge(token)
    Client->>API: GET /api/daily-challenge
    API->>DB: findTodayAttempt(userId, todayUtc())

    alt No attempt yet today
        API->>DB: loadEligibleQuestionIds(userId)<br/>enrolled courses -> their instructors' questions
        DB-->>API: eligible pool (or empty)
        API-->>Client: 200 { attempt: null, available }
        Client-->>Page: render "Start" (disabled if unavailable)
    else Attempt already exists
        API-->>Client: 200 buildAttemptResponse(attempt)<br/>submitted | expired | in-progress
        Client-->>Page: render result / expired / countdown
    end

    Note over Page: Live per-second countdown pinned to deadline_at<br/>(toInstant — server timestamp is authoritative)

    Student->>Page: Clicks "Start"
    Page->>Client: startDailyChallenge(token)
    Client->>API: POST /api/daily-challenge

    API->>DB: findTodayAttempt (idempotent re-check)
    alt Already started (resume or lost race)
        API-->>Client: 200 existing attempt, resumed: true
    else First start today
        API->>DB: loadEligibleQuestionIds(userId)
        DB-->>API: eligible pool
        API->>API: pick one question at random
        API->>DB: INSERT daily_challenge_attempt<br/>deadline_at = now + TIME_LIMIT_SECONDS
        DB-->>API: inserted row (23505: re-fetch existing instead)
        API-->>Client: 201 attempt + question, resumed: false
    end
    Client-->>Page: render question + countdown

    Student->>Page: Selects an option before the deadline
    Page->>Client: submitDailyChallengeAnswer(token, attemptId, optionId)
    Client->>API: POST /api/daily-challenge/{attemptId}/answers
    API->>DB: SELECT attempt WHERE id AND user_id

    alt attempt.submitted_at already set
        API-->>Client: 409 already-submitted body (discloses prior result)
    else deadline_at has passed
        API-->>Client: 409 { expired: true } (row left unfinalized, not written)
    else on time and not yet submitted
        API->>DB: validate selected option belongs to this question
        API->>Rules: scoreForDailyChallenge(isCorrect, maxScore)
        Rules-->>API: score (scoreForAnswer x SCORE_MULTIPLIER)
        API->>DB: UPDATE ... SET submitted_option, is_correct, score, submitted_at<br/>WHERE submitted_at IS NULL
        DB-->>API: updated row (no row: concurrent submit won, re-read and treat as 409)
        API-->>Client: 200 { attempt, correct, explanation, score }
    end

    Client-->>Page: render correct/incorrect + explanation
    Page->>Page: refreshScore() + clearCachedLeaderboard()
    Note over Page: Score rolls into the student's total.<br/>Nothing else invalidates this cache.
    Page-->>Student: shows result and updated total score
